From 1045fecf76e281b7cc73e9d0587f44abe4948fed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "luoyuan.luo" <luoyuan.luo@antgroup.com>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 07:24:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat(moe): add FlashInfer SM90 MXFP4 W4A8 path

Wire the corrected FlashInfer Humming-style MXFP4 x FP8 API into
the Hopper MoE paths while preserving the W4A16 default and
FlashInfer 0.6.17 compatibility.

Add GPT-OSS and DeepSeek-V4 coverage, EP and padding checks,
documentation, and a three-way SM90 benchmark.
