From 2ec959a826c346547658c4d55d651a4c24b931d3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yuan Luo <yuan.luo@hotmail.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 07:13:40 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] fix(mxfp4): compare full FlashInfer Version for the
 Humming gate

The 0.6.18 gate compared Version(...).release[:3] >= (0, 6, 18). The
release tuple drops prerelease markers -- Version("0.6.18rc1").release
is (0, 6, 18) -- so 0.6.18rc*/0.6.18.dev* builds, cut before the
corrected per-expert Humming API landed in the 0.6.18 release, slipped
through the gate. Compare full Versions instead:

